#: ../../faq.rst:2
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../faq.rst:5
msgid "The sequence and GC tracks are grey"
msgstr "序列和 GC 轨道是灰色的"

#: ../../faq.rst:7
msgid ""
"Those tracks need sequence, and sequence is fetched from UCSC. Check that:"
msgstr "这两条轨道需要序列，而序列是从 UCSC 拉取的。请确认："

#: ../../faq.rst:9
msgid "the machine has network access,"
msgstr "机器能访问网络；"

#: ../../faq.rst:10
msgid "``ORBIT_OFFLINE`` is not set to ``1``,"
msgstr "``ORBIT_OFFLINE`` 没有被设成 ``1``；"

#: ../../faq.rst:11
msgid "the assembly has a ``twoBitURL`` in ``data/catalog.json``."
msgstr "该装配在 ``data/catalog.json`` 里有 ``twoBitURL``。"

#: ../../faq.rst:13
msgid ""
"Genes, cytobands, search and imported tracks do not need sequence and keep "
"working either way."
msgstr "基因、细胞遗传带、搜索和导入的轨道都不依赖序列，无论如何都能正常工作。"

#: ../../faq.rst:17
msgid "Loading a locus is slow the first time"
msgstr "第一次加载位点比较慢"

#: ../../faq.rst:19
msgid ""
"That is the range request fetching the 2bit index and the blocks for the "
"window. The first visit to a chromosome takes about a second; moving within "
"it afterwards is roughly 0.3 seconds. If every move is slow, the machine is "
"probably re-resolving DNS — try a local FASTA."
msgstr ""
"这是 Range 请求在取 2bit 索引和窗口覆盖的数据块。首次访问某条染色体约 1 秒，之后在该染色体上移动约 0.3 "
"秒。如果每次移动都很慢，多半是 DNS 反复解析——改用本地 FASTA 试试。"

#: ../../faq.rst:25
msgid "macOS says the app is damaged"
msgstr "macOS 提示应用已损坏"

#: ../../faq.rst:27
msgid "The build is not notarized, so Gatekeeper quarantines it. Run once::"
msgstr "构建产物没有做公证，被 Gatekeeper 隔离了。执行一次："

#: ../../faq.rst:32
msgid "Windows SmartScreen blocked the installer"
msgstr "Windows SmartScreen 拦截了安装包"

#: ../../faq.rst:34
msgid "The installer is not code-signed. Choose **More info → Run anyway**."
msgstr "安装包没有代码签名。选择 **更多信息 → 仍要运行**。"

#: ../../faq.rst:37
msgid "The window opens but stays blank"
msgstr "窗口打开了但一片空白"

#: ../../faq.rst:39
msgid ""
"Check ``orbit.log`` in the settings directory (see :doc:`installation`). A "
"blank window almost always means the backend failed to start — usually a "
"port already in use. Launch with ``--port 8766`` and see whether it comes "
"up."
msgstr ""
"查看设置目录下的 ``orbit.log``，见 :doc:`installation`。白屏几乎总是后端没起来 —— 通常是端口被占用。用 "
"``--port 8766`` 启动试试能否正常打开。"

#: ../../faq.rst:44
msgid "Where are my settings stored?"
msgstr "设置存在哪里？"

#: ../../faq.rst:46
msgid ""
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Orbit`` on Windows, ``~/Library/Application "
"Support/Orbit`` on macOS. Delete the folder to reset everything; the app "
"recreates it on next launch. Set ``ORBIT_HOME`` to use a different location."
msgstr ""
"Windows 在 ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Orbit``，macOS 在 ``~/Library/Application "
"Support/Orbit``。删掉这个目录即可重置一切，应用下次启动会重新创建。设置 ``ORBIT_HOME`` 可以换位置。"

#: ../../faq.rst:51
msgid "Why does a gene label overlap the feature?"
msgstr "为什么基因名字会压在特征上？"

#: ../../faq.rst:53
msgid ""
"When the name does not fit beside the feature, it is drawn on top of it with"
" a translucent background rather than being truncated to ``NM_00…``. That is"
" deliberate: a shortened accession is worse than a slightly busy label."
msgstr "当名字在特征旁边放不下时，会带半透明底板压在特征上，而不是截断成 ``NM_00…``。这是有意为之：缩短的编号比稍微拥挤的标签更糟。"

#: ../../faq.rst:58
msgid "Can I use my own genome?"
msgstr "可以用自己的基因组吗？"

#: ../../faq.rst:60
msgid ""
"Yes — add an entry to ``data/catalog.json`` and a local FASTA, as described "
"in :doc:`assemblies`. Any assembly UCSC hosts also works by pointing "
"``twoBitURL`` at its 2bit file."
msgstr ""
"可以——按 :doc:`assemblies` 所述，在 ``data/catalog.json`` 里加一条并准备本地 FASTA。UCSC "
"上有的装配，把 ``twoBitURL`` 指向它的 2bit 文件也能直接用。"

#: ../../faq.rst:65
msgid "Why is there no batch export?"
msgstr "为什么没有批量导出？"

#: ../../faq.rst:67
msgid ""
"Split view covers most of the need: up to four loci in one canvas, one "
"export. A real batch mode would need a separate renderer that does not "
"depend on the window, which is a larger change than it looks."
msgstr "分屏视图已经覆盖了大部分需求：最多四个位点画在同一块画布上，一次导出。真正的批量模式需要一个不依赖窗口的独立渲染器，改动比看上去大。"

#: ../../faq.rst:72
msgid "Can I run two instances at once?"
msgstr "能同时开两个实例吗？"

#: ../../faq.rst:74
msgid "Yes, with different ports and different state directories::"
msgstr "可以，用不同的端口和不同的状态目录："

#: ../../faq.rst:80
msgid "Does it work offline?"
msgstr "能离线用吗？"

#: ../../faq.rst:82
msgid ""
"With a local FASTA or 2bit, yes. Set ``ORBIT_OFFLINE=1`` to make sure "
"nothing tries to reach the network."
msgstr "配合本地 FASTA 或 2bit 就可以。设 ``ORBIT_OFFLINE=1`` 可确保不会去连网络。"
